# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan pada perkakasan kuantum {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuits for `FakeMiami`. The snapshot behind this fake backend does not list the `reset` and `if_else` instructions that real Nighthawk processors support, so the code below adds them to its target first. The simulator then models reset as noiseless.\n"
msgstr "Transpilasikan litar untuk `FakeMiami`. Syot kilat di sebalik Backend palsu ini tidak menyenaraikan arahan `reset` dan `if_else` yang disokong oleh pemproses Nighthawk sebenar, jadi kod di bawah menambahkannya pada sasarannya terlebih dahulu. Simulator kemudian memodelkan set semula sebagai tanpa hingar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The target qubit layout is a ladder: the GHZ line is a path of $n$ connected qubits, and each W qubit is a neighbor of its GHZ partner, joined by a CZ rung. Many ladders fit on the square lattice, and qubit quality varies across the device, so `choose_layout` picks one from the backend's calibration data. It estimates the expected number of errors of a ladder: the CZ errors of the edges it uses, the readout errors of every measurement, and the dephasing of the GHZ line while the fusion qubits are measured. It grows candidate GHZ lines one qubit at a time, keeping the cheapest, then gives each line its best W qubits. The code passes this layout to the transpiler for all nine circuits, so that every mode runs on the same physical qubits and the comparison between modes is fair. No SWAP gates are needed, and the CZ depth is 4 without error detection and 5 with it. The extra layer is the readout CNOT. The second CNOT of the implicit check merges with the first one into a single CZ, so the implicit and explicit circuits have the same CZ count.\n"
msgstr "Susun atur qubit sasaran ialah tangga: baris GHZ ialah laluan $n$ qubit yang bersambung, dan setiap qubit W ialah jiran pasangan GHZ-nya, disambung oleh anak tangga CZ. Banyak tangga muat pada kekisi segi empat sama, dan kualiti qubit berbeza merentasi peranti, jadi `choose_layout` memilih satu daripada data penentukuran Backend. Ia menganggar bilangan ralat yang dijangka bagi sesuatu tangga: ralat CZ bagi tepi yang digunakan, ralat bacaan bagi setiap pengukuran, dan penyahfasaan baris GHZ semasa qubit gabungan diukur. Ia menumbuhkan baris GHZ calon satu qubit pada satu masa, mengekalkan yang paling murah, kemudian memberikan setiap baris qubit W terbaiknya. Kod menghantar susun atur ini kepada Transpiler untuk kesemua sembilan litar, supaya setiap mod berjalan pada qubit fizikal yang sama dan perbandingan antara mod adalah adil. Tiada get SWAP diperlukan, dan kedalaman CZ ialah 4 tanpa pengesanan ralat dan 5 dengannya. Lapisan tambahan ialah CNOT bacaan. CNOT kedua semakan tersirat bergabung dengan yang pertama menjadi satu CZ, jadi litar tersirat dan eksplisit mempunyai bilangan CZ yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute the expected reference with `exact_reference`, then run the circuits with `SamplerV2` in two ways: the logical circuits on a noiseless `AerSimulator`, and the transpiled circuits on `FakeMiami`, with its noise model. Each `(check, basis)` circuit is one PUB. Store the results in a dictionary with the same keys as `circuits`.\n"
msgstr "Kira rujukan dijangka dengan `exact_reference`, kemudian jalankan litar dengan `SamplerV2` dalam dua cara: litar logikal pada `AerSimulator` tanpa hingar, dan litar yang ditranspilasi pada `FakeMiami`, dengan model hingarnya. Setiap litar `(check, basis)` ialah satu PUB. Simpan keputusan dalam kamus dengan kunci yang sama seperti `circuits`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pascapemprosesan dan pulangkan hasil dalam format klasik yang dikehendaki {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each mode, the table reports:\n"
msgstr "Bagi setiap mod, jadual melaporkan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the **acceptance**: the fraction of shots that pass the DisCo ED check\n"
msgstr "**penerimaan**: pecahan tembakan yang lulus semakan DisCo ED\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "the **success**: the fraction of accepted shots that herald the odd-parity sector, which should match the projection success rate $r_s$\n"
msgstr "**kejayaan**: pecahan tembakan diterima yang memaklumkan sektor pariti ganjil, yang sepatutnya sepadan dengan kadar kejayaan unjuran $r_s$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**P(w=1)** and **C**, computed from the shots that are both accepted and heralded\n"
msgstr "**P(w=1)** dan **C**, dikira daripada tembakan yang diterima dan dimaklumkan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**F**: a lower and an upper bound on the fidelity with $|W_n\\rangle$, computed from the Hamming-weight distribution and $C$ (see `fidelity_bounds`). The paper reports this fidelity, so it is the number to compare with Ref. [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "**F**: batas bawah dan batas atas bagi kesetiaan dengan $|W_n\\rangle$, dikira daripada taburan berat Hamming dan $C$ (lihat `fidelity_bounds`). Kertas kerja itu melaporkan kesetiaan ini, jadi ia ialah nombor untuk dibandingkan dengan Rujukan [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The expected value of $C$ is slightly above 1. This is because the small weight-3 component of the approximate W state has $C = 3(n-3)/(n-1) > 1$ (see the comment in `exact_reference`).\n"
msgstr "Nilai $C$ yang dijangka sedikit melebihi 1. Ini kerana komponen berat-3 yang kecil bagi keadaan W anggaran mempunyai $C = 3(n-3)/(n-1) > 1$ (lihat komen dalam `exact_reference`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, the noiseless run. Every shot passes the DisCo ED check (acceptance = 1), and all three modes agree with the expected reference up to shot noise. Only about 900 of the 4,000 shots per circuit are heralded, so $C$ carries a statistical uncertainty of about $\\pm 0.03$, and deviations of a few hundredths are expected. So the error detection never discards a good shot, and the circuits and postprocessing are correct.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, larian tanpa hingar. Setiap tembakan lulus semakan DisCo ED (penerimaan = 1), dan ketiga-tiga mod selaras dengan rujukan dijangka sehingga hingar tembakan. Hanya kira-kira 900 daripada 4,000 tembakan bagi setiap litar dimaklumkan, jadi $C$ membawa ketidakpastian statistik kira-kira $\\pm 0.03$, dan sisihan beberapa perseratus adalah dijangka. Jadi pengesanan ralat tidak pernah membuang tembakan yang baik, dan litar serta pascapemprosesan adalah betul.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now the noisy run. The plot shows the Hamming-weight distribution of the postselected W state (left), and the two observables $P(w=1)$ and $C$ (right), compared with the expected values (gray).\n"
msgstr "Sekarang larian berhingar. Plot menunjukkan taburan berat Hamming bagi keadaan W yang dipilih selepas (kiri), dan dua cerapan $P(w=1)$ dan $C$ (kanan), dibandingkan dengan nilai dijangka (kelabu).\n"

